🤝 SkillTrade
SkillTrade is a peer-to-peer platform where individuals can exchange skills and knowledge with each other. Whether it's coding for cooking or design for digital marketing, SkillTrade connects learners and experts to trade talents without money.

🚀 Features
👤 User Functionality
🔍 Discover Skills: Browse available skills offered by other users.

🤝 Offer a Skill: List your expertise to trade with others.

🔄 Skill Exchange: Connect with users and propose mutually beneficial exchanges.

💬 In-App Messaging: Chat securely with potential skill partners.

⭐ Ratings & Reviews: Leave feedback to build a trustworthy community.

🛠️ Admin Functionality
👥 User Management: Monitor user activities and resolve conflicts.

🚫 Report & Moderate: Handle abuse reports and content moderation.

📊 Analytics Dashboard: View platform usage statistics and trends.

💡 Tech Stack
Technology	Description
Frontend	React.js, Tailwind CSS
Backend	Node.js, Express.js
Database	MongoDB
Authentication	JWT-based Auth
Realtime Chat	Socket.io
Deployment	Render / Vercel / Heroku

